Project: DiagramFlow
O aplicatie web pentru crearea si colaborarea in timp real asupra diagramelor.

Obiective
Utilizatorii pot:

• crea diagrame
• edita diagrame prin drag & drop
• colabora in timp real
• salva modificarile automat
• exporta diagrame
• partaja proiecte cu alti utilizatori


Tech Stack:
Frontend
• React
• TypeScript
• React Flow sau editor custom
• TailwindCSS
• Zustand
• React Query

Backend:
• NestJS
• PostgreSQL
• Redis
• Socket.IO

Infrastructure:
• Docker
• Docker Compose
• GitHub Actions
• Nginx


MVP Requirements

Authentication
User Registration
- Email
- Password
- Confirm Email
Login
- JWT Access Token
- Refresh Token
Profile
- Update Name
- Avatar
- Password
Dashboard

Post-Login User View:
- My Diagrams
- Create Diagram
- Folders
- Recent
- Shared with Me

Diagram CRUD Operations
The user can:
- Create
- Read
- Update
- Delete
- Duplicate
- Rename
- Move to Folder

Diagram Editor
Features:
- Infinite Canvas

User Capabilities:
- Zoom
- Pan
- Select
- Multi-select
- Drag
- Resize
- Copy
- Paste
- Delete

Shapes
Implementation Requirements:
- Rectangle
- Circle
- Diamond
- Triangle
- Text
- Image
- Sticky Note
- Arrow
- Connector
- Container

Properties Panel
Upon selecting an element, the following properties are available:
- Width
- Height
- Background Color
- Border Color
- Border Size
- Opacity
- Rotation
- Text
- Font
- Alignment
- Layer

Layers
- Bring to Front
- Send Backward
- Bring Forward
- Send to Back

Connections
Functionality for connecting objects.
Example Flow:
Rectangle → Diamond → Circle

Connectors must automatically track the movement of connected objects.

History:
• Undo
• Redo
• History stack
• Autosave

După fiecare modificare:
User moves rectangle → Frontend creates operation → Backend stores operation → Auto-save